# UI/UX Design Rules

- Follow the dark OLED design system defined in `PLAN.md`.
- Display only the current synced lyrics line on screen; previous/next lines are not shown.
- Use vector icons from Lucide or Heroicons; never use emojis as structural icons.
- Respect `prefers-reduced-motion`; provide reduced or no animations when requested.
- Maintain a minimum text contrast ratio of 4.5:1 (WCAG AA).
- Touch targets must be at least 44×44pt on mobile.
- Keep animations performant: use `transform` and `opacity` only, avoid animating `width`/`height`/`top`/`left`.
- Mobile-first responsive design; verify layouts at 375px, 768px, 1024px, and 1440px.
